    <item>
      <title>零日期的选项显示VIX底价如何关税驱动的动荡</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/zero-day-options-0dte-show-how-vix-undersells-trump-tariff-turmoil</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着股票交易者在等待唐纳德·特朗普总统的下一个关税头条新闻，选择市场的一个角落表明了波动性的极端情况。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/zero-day-options-0dte-show-how-vix-undersells-trump-tariff-turmoil</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在全球抛售中</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/citi-sees-more-room-for-rally-in-india-bonds-amid-global-selloff</link>
      <description><![CDATA[Citigroup Inc.的当地市场负责人说，印度的债券集会在美国关税的情况下违反了全球债务市场的崩溃，该集会有足够的余地。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/citi-sees-more-room-for-rally-in-india-bonds-amid-global-selloff</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 09:19:40 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着特朗普的关税战争市场，印度的贸易差距扩大了</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/india-s-trade-gap-widens-as-trump-roils-markets-with-tariff-war</link>
      <description><![CDATA[印度的贸易赤字在3月扩大了，即使南亚国家的政策制定者和出口商争夺美国总统唐纳德·特朗普的全球关税战争。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/india-s-trade-gap-widens-as-trump-roils-markets-with-tariff-war</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 08:54:19 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>债券成功后，香港机场寻求26亿美元的贷款</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/hong-kong-airport-seeks-2-6-billion-loan-following-bond-success</link>
      <description><![CDATA[熟悉此事的人说，香港机场管理局正在寻求一笔约200亿港元（26亿美元）的联合贷款，在完成当地发行人最大的债券供应之一后说。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/hong-kong-airport-seeks-2-6-billion-loan-following-bond-success</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 06:27:29 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>印度是第一个从4月2日关税开始消除损失的主要市场</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/indian-stocks-erase-losses-sparked-by-trump-s-april-2-tariffs</link>
      <description><![CDATA[在一个漫长的周末后，印度股票恢复了交易，基准股票指数删除了美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）本月初的互惠关税触发的所有损失。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/indian-stocks-erase-losses-sparked-by-trump-s-april-2-tariffs</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 06:08:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>国库摊位，十年期限溢价达到十年</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/treasury-term-premium-jumps-to-decade-high-on-policy-uncertainty</link>
      <description><![CDATA[国债停滞不前，而投资者则推动了他们要求的薪酬，以将更长的债券持有到十多年来，这是美国关税政策的后果超过了市场。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/treasury-term-premium-jumps-to-decade-high-on-policy-uncertainty</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 03:03:17 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>随着贸易商对扩大贸易战的反应，黄金边缘更高</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/gold-steadies-just-below-record-as-trade-war-anxiety-simmers</link>
      <description><![CDATA[戈德在周一朝着纪录的高位迈出了纪录，特朗普政府对可能扩大美国盛大贸易战的调查进行了迫使。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-15/gold-steadies-just-below-record-as-trade-war-anxiety-simmers</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 00:28:03 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>股票从自动关税上的缓刑中得到提升：市场包装</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link>
      <description><![CDATA[当美国总统唐纳德·特朗普（Donald Trump）暂停汽车关税时，股票上涨，在暂停某些消费电子产品的税款后，对市场提供了进一步的缓解。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2025-04-14/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 14 Apr 2025 22:56:52 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
